  "description": "Tesseract OCR fallback for scanned PDFs on Windows. Plugs into\n      FieldCure.DocumentParsers as an IDocumentParser for .pdf that renders pages\n      with PDFium and recognizes text with Tesseract when PdfPig yields no content.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
